    <draw:connector draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P1" draw:layer="layout" draw:type="line" svg:x1="174.475cm" svg:y1="84.95cm" svg:x2="174.5cm" svg:y2="94cm" draw:start-shape="id8" draw:start-glue-point="4" draw:end-shape="id9" draw:end-glue-point="4" svg:d="M174475 84950l25 9050" svg:viewBox="0 0 26 9051">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:connector>
    <draw:connector draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P1" draw:layer="layout" draw:type="line" svg:x1="171.5cm" svg:y1="78.75cm" svg:x2="174.475cm" svg:y2="84.95cm" draw:start-shape="id10" draw:start-glue-point="4" draw:end-shape="id8" draw:end-glue-point="4" svg:d="M171500 78750l2975 6200" svg:viewBox="0 0 2976 6201">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:connector>
    <draw:connector draw:style-name="gr1" draw:text-style-name="P1" draw:layer="layout" draw:type="line" svg:x1="178.5cm" svg:y1="77cm" svg:x2="174.475cm" svg:y2="84.95cm" draw:start-shape="id11" draw:start-glue-point="4" draw:end-shape="id8" draw:end-glue-point="4" svg:d="M178500 77000l-4025 7950" svg:viewBox="0 0 4026 7951">
     <text:p/>
    </draw:connector>
    <draw:frame draw:style-name="gr2" draw:text-style-name="P2" draw:layer="layout" svg:width="19.5cm" svg:height="44.372cm" svg:x="137.25cm" svg:y="71.5cm">
     <draw:text-box>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1"># </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">mod</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">ifich</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">e a </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">dsl-</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">mng</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">r</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">## </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">doc</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">ume</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">nto </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">di </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">desi</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">gn</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>si parte dal documento di design.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>al momento non c&apos;è, c&apos;è una analisi e un paio di chat sulla presenza o meno delle funzioni per candidati deterministici (spoiler: non ci sono).</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>i file sono (tra documenti/ e chat/):<text:line-break/><text:line-break/>- analisi_presenza_funzione_candidati_deterministici.md</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- discussione_su_candidati_deterministici_1.md</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- discussione_su_candidati_deterministici_2.md</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>si piglia codex, gli si danno questo file, gli si dice &quot;fammi un documento di design (eventualmente suddiviso in slice, come si vedrà poi) per aggiungere candidati deterministi, altri parser, varie ed eventuali (<text:span text:style-name="T2">tod</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">o</text:span>: devo fare la raccolta di modifiche da inserire)&quot;.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>abbiamo un <text:span text:style-name="T1">tem</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">plate</text:span> per il documento di design? sì:</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- template/template_documento_design.md</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>creato il giorno dopo le discussioni. si piglia codex, gli si dice &quot;fai il documento di design&quot;, gli si dice pure &quot;usa questo template&quot;.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="T1">## </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">slici</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">ng</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>il documento di design viene creato suddiviso per slice (controllato nel template, ci sono). codex decide le slice tutte in una volta, quindi c&apos;è almeno un piano coerente.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>a questo punto il processo è:</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- si usa un prompt fisso (eventuale altro <text:span text:style-name="T3">temp</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">late</text:span>, come si vedrà poi) per creare il prompt di creazione della slice 1 (e poi <text:s/>tutte le altre).</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- una cosa del tipo &quot;leggi questo template di slice (altro <text:span text:style-name="T3">temp</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">late</text:span>), leggi il documento di design, fammi la slice 1&quot;.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- codex scrive il prompt della slice 1.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- penso sia più prudente non dirgli &quot;leggi il design, fai la slice 1&quot;, perché sono tutte diverse e ognuna rappresenti una &quot;ricetta&quot; consultabile e replicabile, con risultati da ottenere, controlli, report, ecc.</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- una volta che hai in mano la slice 1, la fai eseguire a codex. codex implementa la slice, la testa, scrive un report (basato un un ulteriore <text:span text:style-name="T3">temp</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">late</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">anch</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">e </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">ques</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">disp</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">onibil</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">e - </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T2">todo</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">sono </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">un </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">po&apos; </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">spar</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">si e </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">occo</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">rre </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">racc</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">oglie</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">rli, </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">ques</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">to è </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">sotto </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">slicin</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T4">g/</text:span>).</text:p>
      <text:p/>
      <text:p>- i report sono parecchio preziosi, ogni prompt di implementazione di slice chiede di guardare i report vecchi per capire cosa è stato fatto.</text:p>
     </draw:text-box>
    </draw:frame>
    <draw:frame draw:style-name="gr3" draw:text-style-name="P4" xml:id="id9" draw:id="id9" draw:layer="layout" svg:width="5cm" svg:height="5cm" svg:x="172cm" svg:y="91.5cm">
     <draw:text-box>
      <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T1">doc</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">ume</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">nto </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">di </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">desi</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">gn</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T1">(slic</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">e 1 - </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">n)</text:span></text:p>
     </draw:text-box>
     <draw:glue-point draw:id="4" svg:x="0cm" svg:y="0cm"/>
    </draw:frame>
